!results/*.json
*.gguf
AUDIT.md
RESULTS.md
# <<< kleidi-advisor F1.S1 <<<

# >>> kleidi-advisor F6.S1 >>>
# otto-init's .claude/skills/* blanket-ignore (above) is for personal/side-loaded
# skills; kleidi-advisor's own skill is a submission deliverable, not tooling.
# (Needed changing the otto-init line from ".claude/skills/" to ".claude/skills/*":
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory was excluded outright — the
# glob form excludes each entry individually instead, so this negation works.)
!.claude/skills/kleidi-advisor/
!.claude/skills/kleidi-advisor/SKILL.md
